{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DFjvjov9nLWVyyWsvXqeJD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Dpia7BAZGFWPAdwsHB7Eaw","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__director_post_to_reviewer","input":{"text":"[Dream 审稿任务]\n\n你是本次 Dream 模拟论文的唯一 Reviewer，需要一次性覆盖以下三个维度：\n\nA. 方法与实验\n   - 方法描述是否完整、claim 是否被实验数据支撑\n   - 实验设计是否覆盖关键 baseline / ablation / 跨数据集\n   - 数据呈现（表格 / 图）是否能让审稿人复现结论\n\nB. 新颖性与相关工作\n   - 与现有工作的差异化是否清晰、文献覆盖是否充分\n   - Story 是否站得住脚（即使数据是模拟的，论证逻辑必须自洽）\n\nC. 整体评判\n   - 请基于论文内容独立评判，不要假设论文结果的质量高低\n   - 与论文声称矛盾的实验结果 / claim 必须显式指出\n\n**不要评判**：格式、排版、参考文献样式、字数限制。Dream 论文是模拟的，这些维度无意义。\n\n论文 PDF：/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125757/best/review_input_db82206b.pdf\n\n实验设计参考（含想象实验列表）：/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125757/best/review_context.yaml\n\n请通过 `review_reviewer_post_to_director(text, reviewer_id=\"1\", project=\"gen-depth-contamination\", dream_id=\"20260518T125757\")` 汇报。","reviewer_id":"1","project":"gen-depth-contamination","round_number":1},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1898,"cache_read_input_tokens":60390,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1898},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4386e065-524e-48cf-ac64-1eb31a5c6dfc","uuid":"62f5b5e6-c584-404a-978b-b3faaab7ce21"}
